' AI: генерація структури та коду діаграми послідовності (USE-001: пошук → фільтрація → збереження); перевірено: ручне проєктування, рев'ю в PR
@startuml
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 90

actor "Шукач роботи" as User
participant "UI Components\n(Catalog)" as UI
participant "HTTP Gateway Service\n(API Client & Auth Header)" as GW
participant "Storage Service" as Storage
participant "Cache Service\n(In-Memory)" as Cache
participant "Data Repositories\n(EF Core)" as Repo
database "Relational Database\n(MSSQL / SQLite)" as DB

User -> UI : відкрити каталог (стор. 1)
UI -> GW : GET /vacancies?page=1\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>
GW -> Storage : forward + user context
Storage -> Cache : lookup key(page=1, filters)
alt cache hit
    Cache --> Storage : 20 vacancies
else cache miss [PERF-001 <1с, p95]
    Storage -> Repo : find(page=1, filters)
    Repo -> DB : SELECT ... LIMIT 20 OFFSET 0
    DB --> Repo : rows
    Repo --> Storage : entities
    Storage -> Cache : put(key, TTL)
end
Storage --> UI : 200 JSON (20 items)

User -> UI : застосувати фільтри\nstack=Python, format=Remote
UI -> GW : GET /vacancies?stack=Python&format=Remote
GW -> Storage : forward
Storage -> Cache : lookup key(filters)
alt found
    Storage --> UI : 200 JSON (filtered)
else empty [US-002#2]
    Storage -> Repo : find(filters)
    Repo -> DB : SELECT ... WHERE ...
    DB --> Repo : 0 rows
    Repo --> Storage : []
    Storage --> UI : 200 [] + "не знайдено"\n+ кнопка скидання
end

User -> UI : натискає "Зберегти" на vacancy(N)
UI -> GW : POST /saved {vacancy_id=N}
GW -> Storage : forward
Storage -> Repo : insert SavedVacancy(user_id, vacancy_id) [REL-002 sync write]
Repo -> DB : INSERT (PK=user_id,vacancy_id)
DB --> Repo : ok
Repo --> Storage : ok
Storage --> UI : 201 + saved=true
UI --> User : картка "Збережено"
@enduml
